10 REM THE DAY A FLASHCARD ANSWERED ON DAY T IS SHOWN AGAIN (NUTSHELL_RULES.H
11 REM NS2): T + 2 ^ (N - 1) DAYS, N ITS NEXT LEITNER BOX (UP ONE ON RIGHT,
12 REM NEVER PAST 5; BACK TO 1 ON WRONG). B IS 1 .. 5, R 0 .. 1 AND T 0 ..
13 REM 2932896 (9999-12-31, IN DAYS SINCE 1970); THE DUE DAY MAY NOT PASS IT.
20 INPUT B, R, T
30 IF B < 1 THEN 300
40 IF B > 5 THEN 300
50 IF R < 0 THEN 300
60 IF R > 1 THEN 300
70 IF T < 0 THEN 300
80 IF T > 2932896 THEN 300
90 LET N = 1
100 IF R = 0 THEN 140
110 LET N = B + 1
120 IF N < 6 THEN 140
130 LET N = 5
140 LET W = 1
150 FOR K = 2 TO N
160 LET W = W * 2
170 NEXT K
180 IF T + W > 2932896 THEN 300
200 PRINT T + W
210 GOTO 310
300 PRINT "REFUSED"
310 END
